OL,3,GNEWSA'My tribute act keeps Dolly
OL,4,AParton's legacy alive'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of Dolly Parton's leading tribute
OL,7,Facts has said she will continue
OL,8,Fperforming the singer's songs so that
OL,9,Fher "light will never ever go out".
OL,11,FKelly O'Brien, from Aldbury,
OL,12,FHertfordshire, has been impersonating
OL,13,Fthe country music star for about 20
OL,14,Fyears.
OL,16,FShe said she broke down when she
OL,17,Flearned of the singer's death but
OL,18,Fcarried on with The Dolly Show at the
OL,19,FWatford Palace Theatre on Thursday, a
OL,20,Fweek on from the funeral.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
