OL,3,GNEWSA'My tribute act keeps Dolly
OL,4,AParton's legacy alive'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe show was not about "saying goodbye,
OL,7,Fbut celebrating the remarkable life of
OL,8,Fthis amazing woman who has changed the
OL,9,Fworld", she added.
